C","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":3614430618,"text":"着いたぞ、いいところだろう。私は気分転換しによく来るんだ…","nextNodeIds":[220200405]},{"nodeId":220200405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":3623413946,"text":"景色が良くて、空気もおいしい。","nextNodeIds":[220200406]},{"nodeId":220200406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":1605008586,"text":"気になることがあったら、遠慮せずに聞いてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[220200407,220200409]},{"nodeId":220200407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":660205186,"text":"昔、龍二の同僚だったの？","nextNodeIds":[220200408]},{"nodeId":220200408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":3390308226,"text":"龍二から聞いたのか？その通り、確かに私は龍二と共に仕事をしていた。","nextNodeIds":[220200411]},{"nodeId":220200411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":534136090,"text":"当時の出来事について、龍二から聞いているか？","nextNodeIds":[220200412]},{"nodeId":220200412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":3926731754,"text":"簡単に説明すると、龍二はその事件で、衝動的に動いて犯人の罠にかかり、身代わりにされてしまったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[220200413]},{"nodeId":220200413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":3309365514,"text":"私が保証人になっても、判決の担当者は彼を有罪にすべきと主張した。","nextNodeIds":[220200414]},{"nodeId":220200414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":4137435898,"text":"私は色んな人に調査を依頼したが、結局役に立たなかったり、「これ以上調査するな」と言われたりもした。","nextNodeIds":[220200415]},{"nodeId":220200415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":1239064954,"text":"はは、当時の私は…なんというか、警告を受け、言うことを聞いてしまったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[220200416]},{"nodeId":220200416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":1311281306,"text":"この件は、「龍二が濡れ衣を着せられた」件と同じくらい知れ渡っている秘密だから、君に話しても問題ないだろう。","nextNodeIds":[220200417]},{"nodeId":220200417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1653426066,"text":"誰もが知っているんだ…","nextNodeIds":[220200418]},{"nodeId":220200418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":1365158882,"text":"ああ、「誰もが知っていた」からこそ、その事実に気付いたみんなは、あえて事件に突っ込まなくなったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[220200419]},{"nodeId":220200419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":4257334586,"text":"でも幸いなことに、たまたま仕事で奉行所に来た「何も知らない」探偵が、この事件に関心を持ったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[220200420]},{"nodeId":220200420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":2599989730,"text":"その探偵の活躍により、事件は解決し、龍二の無実も証明された。","nextNodeIds":[220200421]},{"nodeId":220200421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":2957443946,"text":"その後、龍二は奉行所を離れ、その探偵の下で働くようになったんだ。物語はここでおしまいだ。","nextNodeIds":[220200422]},{"nodeId":220200422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2961735666,"text":"どうして教えてくれたの？","nextNodeIds":[220200423]},{"nodeId":220200423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":744004514,"text":"誰にプレゼントを頼まれたんだい？","nextNodeIds":[220200424]},{"nodeId":220200424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3766047074,"text":"龍二。","nextNodeIds":[220200425]},{"nodeId":220200425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":1798329546,"text":"龍二がこれを届けに来たのも、きっと「所長の指示」なんだろう。","nextNodeIds":[220200426]},{"nodeId":220200426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":925701074,"text":"龍二の性格から考えると、珊瑚の頼みであれば、たとえ私が火の海に住んでいたとしても、必ずプレゼントを無傷で届けに来た筈だ。","nextNodeIds":[220200427]},{"nodeId":220200427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":1615857962,"text":"君が龍二に頼まれたのなら、それもきっと、珊瑚の指示通りに動いているだけだろう。","nextNodeIds":[220200428]},{"nodeId":220200428,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3427940650,"text":"#珊瑚は{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}にこの件を知って欲しかったの？","nextNodeIds":[220200429]},{"nodeId":220200429,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":1282456194,"text":"ははは、君も鋭いね。君が来てくれたことで、まるで珊瑚が私に「新しい助っ人を雇ったよ」と言ってるみたいだ。","nextNodeIds":[220200430]},{"nodeId":220200430,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":2450352274,"text":"彼女は今でもあの時のことを根に持っているようだな。","nextNodeIds":[220200431]},{"nodeId":220200431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":3865256730,"text":"それもしょうがない、何せ…今になっても、罠を仕掛けた犯人が見つかっていないのだからな…","nextNodeIds":[220200432]},{"nodeId":220200432,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":3803569346,"text":"まあ、教えられることは全部話した。珊瑚の下で働くか働かないかは、君次第だ。","nextNodeIds":[220200433]},{"nodeId":220200433,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":3817099714,"text":"それと、戻ったら、代わりに龍二に礼を言っておいてくれ。大好物の「緋櫻餅」をありがとうってな。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220200409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3779473418,"text":"龍二はどうして奉行所を離れたの？","nextNodeIds":[220200410]},{"nodeId":220200410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3019,"speakerName":"大和田","textMapHash":972056186,"text":"彼が奉行所を離れたのも、彼自身の選択。","nextNodeIds":[220200411]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2202004,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3019","SELECT_NPC_NONE"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_